    "detailed_description": "You don\u2019t have a wife, you\u2019re well over forty, your worldview is firmly formed, but there is no happiness in your life? Don\u2019t worry, you just need to remember your Skoofuslugi password, and in a few clicks you can get your rightful alt girl!<br><br>Immersive first-person skoof simulator in a visual novella format, cobbled together within one month \u2013 it\u2019s the best you can get in this genre with this amount of money. Okay, you can find better things. You\u2019re right. By the way, what\u2019s \u201cimmersive\u201d?<br><br><i>SKOOF - In Russian contemporary slang, the word means a kind of nasty man about 30-50 years old, looking older than he actually is, due to bad physical condition, obesity, baldness, smoking, bad job, ugly wife and three kids etc. (Urban Dictionary)</i><br><i>ALTOOSHKA - literally means alt girl, but in more Russian way. Alt girls are supposed to be girls that wear alternative fashion (goth, emo, etc.), listen to non-mainstream music, and are usually left winged. </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>It\u2019s the first game about skoofs and alt girls. <br></li><li>Feel like a forty year old unmarried man, overweight and lacking hair.<br></li><li>It\u2019s a unique experience and a short but high-quality immersion.<br></li><li>The authors of the game are comic book writer Vitaliy Terletski and viral anime videos creator RIKANI.<br></li><li>The composer is Nikita Kryukov (\u2018Milk outside a bag of milk outside a bag of milk\u2019).<br></li><li>Three alt girl to choose from, almost to everyone\u2019s taste.<br></li><li>The inner voice of the main character is dubbed by Prophet Sunboy (a real one).<br></li><li>A diverse choice system which doesn\u2019t make much difference in the end.<br></li><li>At least 5 (five) different endings.</li></ul>",
